exas double-digit faves at Texas A&M","description":"This week's odds and FPI predictions for UCLA-USC, Texas A&M-Texas and more.","published":"2026-11-25T15:00:51.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/50571004/2026-college-football-week-13-top-25-betting-lines-odds","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Sources: Manuel to remain Michigan AD until new hire is found","description":"Warde Manuel has agreed to stay in the job as Michigan's athletic director until the school finds a new athletic director, sources told ESPN on Wednesday.","published":"2026-11-25T16:12:47.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50592920/sources-manuel-stay-job-new-michigan-ad-hired","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Pete Thamel and Dan Wetzel","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5223986/leroy-harris-iii","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leroy_Harris_III"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Leroy Harris III","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leroy_Harris_III","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-25T17:07:20Z","intro":"Leroy Harris III is an American football defensive end for the Kansas Jayhawks. He previously played for the Chattanooga Mocs.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Harris III attended Christ Presbyterian Academy in Nashville, Tennessee, and committed to play college football for the Chattanooga Mocs."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"As a freshman in 2024, Harris III played in all 12 games for Chattanooga, notching 11 tackles with half a tackle being for a loss, three fumble recoveries, and a touchdown, earning FCS All-American honors. After the conclusion of the season, he entered the NCAA transfer portal.\nHarris III transferred to play for the Kansas Jayhawks. In 2025, he totaled 31 tackles with six and a half being for a loss, four and a half sacks, and eight pass deflections."}]}}